<card id="c" title="Zla Kolata and Prokletije: 300 Euros There and Back">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>First thing, I took a shower. Then I pitched the tent, inflated the mattress, laid out the sleeping bag, assembled the stove, turned my chair to face the mountains and started cooking beef goulash, sipping a beer. It was awesome.</p>
<p>Until dinner I just took in the views. After dinner I had tea with cantuccini I&apos;d brought from Belgrade and went to sleep. What a long and wonderful day it turned out to be.</p>
